<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rainbow announces results of rights offers.</title>
<headline>Rainbow announces results of rights offers.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rainbow Chicken's rights offer of 884,4-million convertible preference shares of 85 cents each was 74.2 percent subscribed, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>The rights offers of controlling shareholders Hunt Leuchars &amp; Hepburn Holdings Ltd and Huntcor Ltd for 121-million and 45.7-million preference shares were 99.4 percent and 98.7 percent subscribed.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
